     "body": "<p>A new use case document has been added (fedora_sso_use_case2.pdf). This replaces fedora_sso_use_case.pdf.</p>\n\n<p>There are some questions about how an upstream filter can play nice with scripts (which can't use such an authN method), and also how the JAAS filter can play nice with an upstream filter. It is exciting stuff, so feel free to start/join a discussion.</p>",
     "created": "17/Nov/11 12:52 PM",
